OL,3,C'Animals are not accessories': RSPCA
OL,4,Cwarns against breeding flat-faced dogs
OL,6,FA record number of flat-faced dog
OL,7,Fbreeds are being abandoned in the UK
OL,8,Fas owners struggle to cope with rising
OL,9,Fvet bills, the RSPCA has warned.
OL,11,FThe animal welfare charity revealed it
OL,12,Fhad seen a 3,800% increase in the
OL,13,Fnumber of French bulldogs coming into
OL,14,Fits care in the last 10 years.
OL,16,FIn 2016, the RSPCA took in just six
OL,17,FFrench bulldogs, also known as
OL,18,FFrenchies, but that figure rose to 234
OL,19,Flast year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
