OL,3,C'Animals are not accessories': RSPCA
OL,4,Cwarns against breeding flat-faced dogs
OL,6,FFrench bulldogs have become one of the
OL,7,FUK's most popular pedigree breeds, but
OL,8,Ftheir flat-faced features can often
OL,9,Flead to a range of health issues -
OL,10,Fincluding breathing difficulties.
OL,12,FThese complications can result in
OL,13,Fexpensive, and invasive surgery, to
OL,14,Fhelp the dogs breathe - hitting owners
OL,15,Fin the pocket with crippling vet bills.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
