OL,3,C'Animals are not accessories': RSPCA
OL,4,Cwarns against breeding flat-faced dogs
OL,6,FIn a new report titled: 'The Shape of
OL,7,FSuffering', the charity described the
OL,8,Fissue as "one of the biggest welfare
OL,9,Fproblems pets face today " and called
OL,10,Ffor owners and breeders to "end the
OL,11,Fsuffering".
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
