OL,3,C'Animals are not accessories': RSPCA
OL,4,Cwarns against breeding flat-faced dogs
OL,6,F"The disturbing truth is, these pets
OL,7,Fare essentially being bred to suffer
OL,8,Fbecause people, and society, want them
OL,9,Fto look a certain way - there is no
OL,10,Fother reason to breed these traits
OL,11,Finto them other than desire for a
OL,12,Fparticular aesthetic," RSPCA
OL,13,FScientific and Policy Manager Ashleigh
OL,14,FBrown, lead author of the report, said.
OL,16,F"But animals are not accessories, and
OL,17,Fno animal should suffer just to look
OL,18,Ffashionable or meet the latest trend."
