OL,3,C'Animals are not accessories': RSPCA
OL,4,Cwarns against breeding flat-faced dogs
OL,6,FThe charity said it had also seen an
OL,7,Falarming rise in British Bulldogs
OL,8,Fbeing handed in, while there was also
OL,9,Fa 192% jump in Pugs coming into RSPCA
OL,10,Fcentres in 2025 compared to 2016.
OL,12,FTony Randall rescued a bulldog called
OL,13,FGrace who had been bred by a previous
OL,14,Fowner.
OL,16,FSpeaking on ITV's Good Morning
OL,17,FBritain, Mr Randall pleaded with
OL,18,Fanyone thinking of buying a flat-faced
OL,19,Fbreed to think twice.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
