OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785219528
OL,3,C'Animals are not accessories': RSPCA
OL,4,Cwarns against breeding flat-faced dogs
OL,6,F"Having Grace and knowing what her
OL,7,Ffuture holds, I wouldn't want anyone
OL,8,Felse to go through that," he said.
OL,10,F"She's got back problems, and
OL,11,Feventually her back will give in
OL,12,Fbecause of the way she's been bred."
